            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This soup has potential, but there is way too much water and not enough spices. I used crushed tomatoes because my store didn't have puree, and I used a 28 oz can. I only used 2½ cups of water and added an extra cup of broth, plus I doubled the spices and doubled the cheese. I didn't have carrots, but I used a whole can each of green beans, potatoes and corn. It was really good with changes. It would be rather bland as written.",
